        "Provide traceable part and revision identification without damaging critical fibres or bond areas. Keep the original qualification evidence, permitted modifications, replacement orientation and assembly instructions available to maintenance personnel. After an abnormal stop or collision, review the event against the OEM procedure rather than relying only on appearance. Production release should identify the exact drawing, material, process and joint configuration accepted by the customer.",
